  "remarks": "TAi.144 Designation: Na'ib Amir (Deputy Commander) (1996-2001). Passport no: a) Afghanistan P00032260, issued on 30 Jun. 2022 in Kabul, Afghanistan, expires 30 Jun. 2032 (Name in Latin script: Abdul Satar Abdullah) b) Afghanistan number D0010367, issued on 18 May 2024, issued in Kabul, Afghanistan, expires 18 May 2029 (Name in Latin script: Sirajuddin Haqqani). Heading the Haqqani Network (TAe.012) as of late 2012. Son of Jallaloudine Haqani (TAi.040). Belongs to Sultan Khel section, Zadran tribe of Garda Saray of Paktia province, Afghanistan. Height: 187 cm.; Listing: Listed on 13 Sept. 2007 (amended 22 April 2013, 10 Mar. 2026, 28 Apr. 2026)",
